<title>USA: Maxwell Technologies sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Maxwell Technologies sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxwell Technologies Inc Wednesday said its board of directors declared a two-for-one split of the company's common shares, effected as a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split is subject to receipt of final approval of the shareholders to increase the number of authorized shares from five million to 20 million shares.</p>
<p>The 100 percent stock dividend will be paid to shareholders of record on November 26, with the distribution date scheduled for December 17.</p>
<p>After giving effect to the stock split, Maxwell will have approximately six million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
